# ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
#
# Deploy Orchestrator — orchestrator-specific env vars
# Copy to .env and fill in values before running the stack.
# ASTRO_BUILD_TRIGGER_SECRET comes from abcnorio-meta/.env (injected via compose environment).

# Allow direct POST /trigger calls without a WP save event (0 to disable)
ORCHESTRATOR_ALLOW_MANUAL_TRIGGER=1

# HTTP port the orchestrator listens on
ORCHESTRATOR_PORT=4011

# Max build archives to retain per target (production, staging, preview)
MAX_BACKUPS=5
